OL,3,GNEWSAWhy children's hospices are paying
OL,4,Ato throw away your donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is money that could otherwise help
OL,7,Ffund specialist care for seriously ill
OL,8,Fchildren and their families. The
OL,9,Fcharity says its services cost more
OL,10,Fthan #40,000 a day to run.
